---
/** Mini interaction plot: dua garis bersilang (efek interaksi A×B). */
const grid = [
  { value: '55', y: 44 },
  { value: '50', y: 72 },
  { value: '45', y: 100 },
];
---

<figure class="plot">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 320 158" role="img" aria-labelledby="ml-plot-title ml-plot-desc">
    <title id="ml-plot-title">Grafik interaksi dua faktor A dan B</title>
    <desc id="ml-plot-desc">Garis B1 naik dari 42,5 ke 57,5 MPa, garis B2 turun dari 54,5 ke 45,5 MPa. Kedua garis bersilang di tengah, menandakan interaksi A kali B yang signifikan.</desc>

    <text x="38" y="10" class="axis-name">Respons (MPa)</text>
    {grid.map((g) => (
      <g>
        <line x1="38" x2="296" y1={g.y} y2={g.y} class="grid-line" />
        <text x="32" y={g.y + 3} class="axis-tick" text-anchor="end">{g.value}</text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <line x1="38" x2="296" y1="128" y2="128" class="axis-line" />
    <line x1="38" x2="38" y1="14" y2="128" class="axis-line" />

    <!-- B1: garis solid + penanda lingkaran -->
    <path d="M38 114 L296 30" class="line-b1" />
    <circle cx="38" cy="114" r="4" class="dot-b1" />
    <circle cx="296" cy="30" r="4" class="dot-b1" />

    <!-- B2: garis putus-putus + penanda kotak (tidak hanya beda warna) -->
    <path d="M38 46.8 L296 97.2" class="line-b2" />
    <rect x="34" y="42.8" width="8" height="8" rx="1.5" class="square-b2" />
    <rect x="292" y="93.2" width="8" height="8" rx="1.5" class="square-b2" />

    <!-- Titik silang -->
    <circle cx="167" cy="72" r="7" class="cross-ring" />
    <text x="167" y="62" class="cross-label" text-anchor="middle">A×B</text>

    <text x="38" y="145" class="axis-tick" text-anchor="middle">A₁ (60 °C)</text>
    <text x="296" y="145" class="axis-tick" text-anchor="middle">A₂ (72 °C)</text>
  </svg>

  <div class="legend" aria-hidden="true">
    <span><i class="key key-solid"></i><i class="shape shape-circle"></i>B₁ · 10 menit</span>
    <span><i class="key key-dashed"></i><i class="shape shape-square"></i>B₂ · 18 menit</span>
  </div>
  <figcaption>Garis bersilang di tengah → interaksi A×B nyata; OFAT akan melewatkannya.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .plot { margin: .8rem 0 0; }
  svg { width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .axis-name, .axis-tick { font-family: var(--font-ui); fill: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 10px; }
  .axis-name { font-weight: 600; }
  .axis-tick { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 9.5px; }
  .grid-line { stroke: var(--surface-border); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; }
  .axis-line { stroke: var(--ink-soft); stroke-width: 1; opacity: .65; }
  .line-b1 { fill: none; stroke: var(--accent); stroke-width: 2.6; stroke-linecap: round; }
  .line-b2 { fill: none; stroke: var(--danger); stroke-width: 2.6; stroke-dasharray: 7 5; stroke-linecap: round; }
  .dot-b1 { fill: var(--accent); stroke: #fff; stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .square-b2 { fill: var(--danger); stroke: #fff; stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .cross-ring { fill: none; stroke: var(--warn); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 2 3; }
  .cross-label { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 9px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--ink); }
  .legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .9rem; margin-top: .45rem;
    font-size: .68rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .legend span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .3rem; }
  .key { display: inline-block; width: 15px; height: 0; border-top: 2px solid var(--accent); }
  .key-dashed { border-top: 2px dashed var(--danger); }
  .shape { display: inline-block; width: 6px; height: 6px; }
  .shape-circle { border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); }
  .shape-square { border-radius: 1px; background: var(--danger); }
  figcaption { margin-top: .55rem; padding-top: .5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--surface-border);
    font-size: .68rem; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.45; }
</style>
